<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>COFICAB - Tool Shop QR Poster</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .poster-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      max-width: 480px;
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .title {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .sub {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .desc {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #334155;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .qr-box {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 3px dashed #0284c7;
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .qr-box img {
      width: 250px;
      height: 250px;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .cta {
      background-color: #0284c7;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .btn-print {
      background-color: #0f172a;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      transition: background 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-print:hover {
      background-color: #1e293b;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* تنسيق للطباعة فقط */
    @media print {
      body {
        background: white;
      }
      .btn-print {
        display: none;
      }
      .poster-card {
        box-shadow: none;
        border: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="poster-card">
    <h1 class="title">COFICAB - Tool Shop</h1>
    <p class="sub">إدارة ومتابعة مكونات خطوط السحب والكبس</p>
    <p class="desc">امسح الـ QR Code للوصول السريع للنظام</p>

    <div class="qr-box">
      <img src="https://quickchart.io/qr?text=https://hassanyaman53-cyber.github.io/Tool-Shoop-coficab/&size=300&margin=2" alt="QR Code">
    </div>

    <div>
      <span class="cta">امسح الكود هنا SCAN HERE</span>
    </div>

    <button class="btn-print" onclick="window.print()">طباعة البوستر 🖨️</button>

    <div class="footer">
      COFICAB Tool Shop System © 2026
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
           
